{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:735","content":{"id":735,"title":"为什么会写一个笔记软件","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"48cb74ad-1fd9-485c-8ccc-7593ea4409e6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我是一个非常喜欢记笔记的人，最开始记笔记可能是为了缓解焦虑，给我带来安全感，特别是在上完一节课之后什么都没记住，如果连笔记都没有就更让人焦虑，感觉这节课就白上了，白白浪费了时间。在这个时期，我记笔记的方式在纸质笔记本上手写，要么是课堂笔记，要么是抄 PPT。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"0a8ba7ff-72e1-4f91-87e1-4fe0a3fda476","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这种行为明显是低效的，因为抄笔记这个行为根本无法激活大脑思考，过了一两天，就会风消云散，而且抄笔记这个行为非常的耗时间，性价比简直低到了极点。但是因为找不到其他办法，如果不做，就会有一种焦虑感，因此这种做法我持续了很久。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"afbfee03-cb35-49e6-b813-8ab2b2dd621c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"直到我开始学习编程，博客这个东西在编程圈特别火，似乎每个人都会去折腾自己的个人网站，然后在上面写点文章，分享技术心得，甚至分享生活。我也是在这里第一次接触到了写博客这件事情，并且了解到了 Markdown 这个在程序员圈标配的文档格式，这仿佛打开了新世界的大门，数学公式，绘图，富文本仅仅通过文字即可表达。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"2fa96a3d-af9e-405b-9008-fabc1fa43a89","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这给我带来两个改变，一个是从手写笔记转变到电子笔记，摆脱了每次都要携带本子的问题，也拜托了每次笔记记得手抽筋的问题；第二个是从记笔记到“写笔记”，我不在是边上课边记笔记，而是以发表博客的目的，在课后进行广泛搜索，验证，输出一篇播客，从被动学习变为了主动学习，我记得当时我学《数字信号处理》时，写了二十多篇文章，期末考试的时候，基本上没有不会的题目，只花了一半的时间就交卷了，现在文章还在 "},{"type":"link","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/the_last_knight/category_9280989.html","openEdit":false,"collabId":"0467752d-90cf-416e-818d-da670ff057f5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CSDN"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"6329fb6c-b8c6-4884-8abf-384dc51bf974","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最开始我是在 CSDN 上进行写作，但是 CSDN 越来越难以满足我的需求，我把目光投向了个人播客，毕竟幸幸苦苦写出来的文章，不发出去让别人看到，乐趣都少了一半（虽然没什么人看），所以就开始了我的博客折腾之旅，包括："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"691107e2-b2ab-4443-ad1d-8c8c44d8017c","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"fea0473e-67a2-47a9-8141-390d6bccf724","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"ea11ebb5-2437-4f98-9e49-a56b3bdfa654","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Docsify"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"83ebe34e-a333-4cf0-a59b-a398d391991d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"8291520f-dc30-4e4e-a05b-f95b232d9d53","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Hexo"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"3bb6ad22-7437-41fa-bbb8-b2abb434a50e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"85ccacbf-bfef-4cf8-a68d-0808f653d22f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Vuepress"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"78a19cfa-6323-4d9b-bffd-50c56eafac16","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"6ab61d2a-cec7-4d70-8b9a-78709a8aa16f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"... ..."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"ad5f3493-7e75-4a49-9061-7041b8ea8378","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"基本上主流的、能叫的上名字的我都试过，并且折腾过，各种插件，各种样式，就为了把博客网站打造的好一点，这个阶段我面临两个问题："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"b15ee3af-dea1-4737-8c6f-52480d853fc6","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"2b2ad38f-9637-4036-93cd-3aa220fe516b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"674f98b7-46e5-44f6-b714-3b0fd1a03ca0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我的很多时间花在折腾博客上，换不同的博客框架，折腾插件等等，但真正重要的花在写作上的时间反而很少"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"00aeb696-946f-4f57-8a9b-891bb4c5b91e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"158f3ef6-eb88-4190-b99d-de8b7973e77b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"博客适合发表文章，它是一个输出的平台，但是不适合知识管理，我如何处理我的输入，我如何在我需要的时候能快速查找到相关笔记"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"a819030a-51ef-49f2-8977-c0a3b5bc1ccb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因此我需要一个软件来管理我的知识文档，在当时 Notion 可谓是如日中天，我第一次接触到时也是惊为天人，之前我在播客中折腾的插件这边大部分都支持，开箱即用，而且 Notion 的设计也很美观，不用自己去折腾样式，所以很快，我就开始把 Notion 作为我的知识管理软件。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"ac954c3b-877e-43b9-aa60-c9c49d181558","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是，我很快发现 Notion 无法满足我的很多需求，比如在博客中我可以自定义渲染内容，比如 Tab"}]},{"type":"tabs","collabId":"ba5ac70b-b450-48ab-af74-5c4d54a68f3a","activeKey":"8f2d3c2f-155c-4c4e-9297-919812a7d0a1","children":[{"type":"tab-pane","tabKey":"8f2d3c2f-155c-4c4e-9297-919812a7d0a1","title":"HTML","collabId":"b0adaf24-1f4f-4de6-80c5-defd39b658fd","children":[{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"6db3b94b-57d4-41b9-b1f2-23e3fe1c3612","collabId":"e24c0fbe-8bbe-48a4-81c2-1b6de79f3b88","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<div id=\"content\">Hello</div>"}]},{"type":"tab-pane","tabKey":"ec7c66d5-7702-4ae5-9ff6-a6d6cb5b3b82","title":"CSS","collabId":"90576395-f0b2-41a9-90d1-029bdd626e21","children":[{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"e1ccd52e-dcdb-4378-90ea-0c9235b6f04f","collabId":"83fa1866-650f-4c36-b78e-3b00661cd43c","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"#content {\n  color: red;\n}"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"401d0ab2-786a-4448-af66-655c746f7ff0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这在 Notion 中根本没有可能做到，或者代价很高，且不灵活，对于一名前端工程师来说，就仿佛失去了一项非常重要的技能，另外就是 Notion 的网络问题，必须开着🪜才能访问到，否则就是龟速。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d4fddaad-85db-4a58-805a-18e065cbfe46","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此时 Obsidian 进入我的视线，一款本地离线的笔记应用，通过各种插件来增强应用能力，插件市场上真的什么都有，最吸引我的就是，我自己也可以写插件来自定义我想要的功能，自定义对我有一种无法抵抗的吸引力，所以很快我就把 Obsidian 作为了我的知识管理软件，我也写了一些插件来满足我的需求。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"8a471d1e-6f3d-4bec-ba1f-4f3b55fafa50","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是使用 Obsidian 我也遇到了一些让人非常苦恼的问题："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"c1c65d8a-ed3d-4cf0-b247-ca8e8b9d5edc","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"510005a2-19ad-403e-bd9d-dad69e833c5a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"2e7c1f08-d292-4dbd-870e-4f5782401825","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"软件功能非常简陋，基本上无法离开第三方插件市场，因此需要花很多时间折腾插件上，并且软件的内容也需要和插件绑定，失去了插件，就无法渲染出想要的样式，甚至失去功能"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"42d5a036-ed6b-402a-808e-e3959d158373","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7259e501-6512-4d4d-89f3-0aa05f050880","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"编辑体验非常差，体验过 Typora 和 Notion 的所见即所得的编辑能力后，对于 Obsidian 的编辑体验根本无法忍受"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"6519a896-99c3-47e2-a4e4-2a8cec3f4433","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"特别是第二点，我是有一点强迫症，每天面对这种糟糕的编辑体验，有一天我萌生出一个念头，我能不能写一个类似于 Typora 和 Notion 一样编辑体验的软件，这个想法一直萦绕在我的脑海中，直到 2023-05-01，劳动节，我决定开始试试，因此这款软件就这么诞生了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"893b2f61-b9f8-4d31-8b01-c0fba798857f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"起初，我只是想写一个富文本编辑器，把这个富文本编辑器作为 Obsidian 的插件，去改善编辑体验，但是我开始接触到一些知识管理的一些东西，比如《卡片笔记写作法》、《打造第二大脑》、《笔记的方法》以及接触到一些其它的笔记软件，以及这些年我面临的一些问题，我的一些思考，我决定把它打造为一个知识管理软件。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"软件使用文档","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:735","type":"doc","id":735}},{"label":"为什么会写一个笔记软件","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:735","type":"doc","id":735}}],"nextPage":{"title":"编辑器","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:736","type":"doc","id":736}},"createTime":1765726548524,"updateTime":1789186178350,"projectId":48},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1789186178350}}